BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :—

1. This Act may be cited as the PahalagamaSri Somarathana Nayaka Thero Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No. 35 of 2011.

3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be—

(a)to conduct Dhamma sermons, discussions andseminars;

Incorporation ofthe PahalagamaSri SomarathanaNayaka TheroFoundation.

General Objectsof theCorporation.

