BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:—

1.This Act may be cited as the AnuradhapuraSri Pushpadana Development Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No. 34 of 2011.

3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be—

(a)to safeguard the Buddhist cultural heritage withinthe sacred area in Anuradhapura;

Incorporationof theAnuradhapuraSri PushpadanaDevelopmentFoundation.

